  "description": "Yoo-Jin is bad boyfriend material. It’s partially because he never takes anything seriously, but it’s also because he’s never had a great time in bed with anyone. After being publicly dumped, he’s approached by Hyeon-Soo, an old high school classmate who also happens to be Yoo-Jin’s first love. After a round of drinks, they spend a heated night together that might have been a great time, but Yoo-Jin remembers none of it. Torn between denial and desire, Yoo-Jin has to decide whether he’s serious about Hyeon-Soo... which would be a lot easier if they could ever have a proper conversation.\n\n(Source: Tappytoon)",
